// Luther_21_1_769             Nay!
// Christof_21_1_770           Aye! ‘Tis so.
// Luther_21_1_771             Aye. Tis so. Wilt thou do this for me all the same? It is more than I may ask of thee, yet I ask it all the same. Wilt thou take my sins upon thee?
